ECI Files commissioner photos — sources and licences
=====================================================

Every photo in this directory is self-hosted from Wikimedia Commons under the Government Open
Data License - India (GODL-India), which permits use, adaptation and publication for commercial and
non-commercial purposes on condition that the provider, source and licence are acknowledged. Each
file below is cropped from its Commons original to the face; the State Emblem is kept out of frame
where possible and is never used as a graphic (GODL-India excludes official names, crests and logos
from the licence grant).

Full records, including original publisher, photo date and per-file licence review status, are in
data/eci_files/people_media.json. This file is a flat index for a human reading the directory.

